{
  "description": "a pool whose library has an identifier is named by it in the origin records: the records written under the path of the pool (earlier builds) move to the identifier at the next exchange (file pool-<first 6 digits of the sha1 of the id>.bib, papers-pool-path); after the pool moved, papers config pool NEWPATH finds the records again under the same identifier",
  "sections": [
    "exchange.md#2.3",
    "exchange.md#3.1",
    "exchange.md#3.2",
    "exchange.md#3.9"
  ],
  "tests": [
    "tests/test_spec_exchange.py::TestOriginFiles::test_identifier_file_named_after_the_folder",
